{"id":"e_cran","lemma":"écran","pos":"noun","rank":1703,"glosses":["screen"],"ipa":"/e.kʁɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/Fr-%C3%A9cran.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9cran.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"écrans"},"formAudio":{"écrans":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-%C3%A9crans.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon écran est fendillé.","en":"My screen is cracked.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"L'écran ne fonctionne plus.","en":"The monitor stopped working.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to function, to work","l":"fonctionner"},{"g":"more / no longer"}]},{"text":"Tous les yeux étaient braqués sur les écrans.","en":"Everyone's eyes were fixed on the screens.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"eye","l":"œil"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Un écran séparait la pièce en deux.","en":"A screen divided the room into two.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to separate","l":"séparer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"two"}]},{"text":"La jeune fille voulait être une star du grand écran.","en":"The young girl wanted to be a star of the silver screen.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"star"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"big"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"a girl"]]}]}